flowchart TD
    %% Level 1 DFD - Order Data Flow Only
    %% Simple view: external entities, processes, data stores
    %% Based on DATA_FLOW_DIAGRAM.md Process 2.0 Order Processing

    SR[Sales Representative]
    PA[Pharmacist/Admin]

    P1[1.0 Manage Cart]
    P2[2.0 Create Order]
    P3[3.0 Update Order Status]

    D1[(D1: Cart)]
    D2[(D2: Order)]
    D3[(D3: Order Status History)]

    %% Sales Rep: cart and order creation
    SR -->|Cart items| P1
    SR -->|Customer info| P2
    P1 -->|Cart data| D1
    D1 -->|Cart data| P1
    P1 -->|Cart contents| P2
    P2 -->|Order| D2
    P2 -->|Status history| D3
    D2 -->|Order data| P2
    P2 -->|Order confirmation| SR

    %% Pharmacist: status updates
    PA -->|Status update| P3
    D2 -->|Orders| P3
    D3 -->|History| P3
    P3 -->|Updated order| D2
    P3 -->|Status history| D3
    P3 -->|Order details| PA

    %% Sales Rep views orders
    SR -->|Order query| P2
    P2 -->|Order details| SR

    classDef entity fill:#e1f5ff,stroke:#0066cc
    classDef process fill:#fff4e1,stroke:#ff6600
    classDef store fill:#e1ffe1,stroke:#00cc00
    class SR,PA entity
    class P1,P2,P3 process
    class D1,D2,D3 store
